# Category-partition spec for VibeMatchAgent.run(request)
# Compile: tslcompiler -o vibematch_agent.tsl.txt vibematch_agent.tsl
#
# Parameters: the free-text request (size, intent, and what it says)
# Environment: retrieval on/off, LLM behaviour, listener feedback state

# ---------------- Parameter: request text ----------------
  Request size:
    normal length.
    empty.                                              [error]
    whitespace only.                                    [error]
    exactly 500 characters.                             [single]
    over 500 characters.                                [error]

  Request intent:
    music request.
    prompt injection.                                   [error]
    off-topic task with no music words.                 [error]
    off-topic keyword inside a music request.           [single]
    no mood, genre, activity, or energy at all.         [error]

  Mood wording:
    none.
    catalog mood word.                                  
    word not in catalog, mapped by glossary.            
    glossary synonym of a catalog mood.                 [single]
    two moods in one request.                           [single]
    negated mood.                                       [single]

  Genre wording:
    none.
    catalog genre word.                                 
    word not in catalog, mapped by glossary.            [single]
    glossary synonym of a catalog genre.                [single]
    phrase containing a shorter genre.                  [single]
    genre unknown to the glossary.                      [single]
    negated genre.                                      [single]

  Activity wording:
    none.
    one activity.                                       
    two activities.                                     [single]

  Energy wording:
    none.
    explicit low word.                                  [single]
    explicit high word.                                 [single]
    numeric value.                                      [single]
    negated high word.                                  [single]
    conflicts with the genre.                           [single]

  Length wording:
    none.
    minutes in range.                                   [property Duration]
    song count in range.                                [single]
    hours.                                              [single]
    hyphenated minutes.                                 [single]
    compound hours and minutes.                         [single]
    shortest allowed length.                            [single]
    longest allowed length.                             [single]
    below minimum.                                      [single]
    above maximum.                                      [single]

  Vocals wording:
    none.
    wants instrumental.                                 [if Duration]
    wants vocals.                                       [single]
    instrumental phrase that contains a vocal phrase.   [single]

  Arc wording:
    none.
    build.                                              [single]
    peak (warm up and cool down).                       [single]
    wind-down.                                          [single]

# ---------------- Environment ----------------
  Retrieval:
    on.
    off.                                                [single]

  LLM behaviour:
    offline parser.
    raises an error (outage).                           [single]
    returns out-of-range values and unknown fields.     [single]
    returns non-numeric confidence.                     [single]
    returns a list where a string is expected.          [single]
    intro names a song outside the playlist.            [single]

  Listener feedback:
    no songs excluded.
    some songs excluded.                                [single]
    every song meeting a hard constraint excluded.      [single]
